# "When this artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card": any trip to the graveyard counts, not
# only its own sacrifice, and a trip anywhere else does not. Bot1 has two Stars out. On turn two Bot2's Disenchant
# destroys one: it goes to the graveyard and Bot1 draws (hand 3 -> 4). On turn four Bot2's Prismatic Ending (X=1, one
# color spent) exiles the other: no graveyard, no draw (hand 5 -> 5, after the turn-three draw).

